DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The aaccppiipprrtt driver provides interrupt mapping information for PCI devices
     based on information from ACPI PCI Routing Table objects.  Typically
     there is one PCI Routing Table object for every PCI bus in the system,
     each handled by a separate aaccppiipprrtt device.

